{
  "version": 1,
  "discipline": "PT",
  "kind": "reassessment",
  "title": "康复阶段性复评记录（PT运动）",
  "trigger": {
    "every_n": 20,
    "mandatory": true
  },
  "$comment": [
    "★ 本模板的客观字段（o 段）**与 initial.json 共用同一套 key** ——",
    "  这是『每 20 次复评』能自动算出功能变化、出院小结能自动汇总",
    "  『下肢肌力 2级→3级、坐位平衡 Ⅱ→Ⅲ级』的**前提**。",
    "  改这里的 key 必须同步改 initial.json，否则汇总会静默失效。",
    "",
    "★ prefill=last_assessment：进来时自动带出该大类上一次的评估值（首评或上次复评），",
    "  治疗师只改变化的项 —— 复评从『重填 40 项』变成『改 5-8 项』。"
  ],
  "soap": [
    {
      "key": "s",
      "label": "S",
      "heading": "主观资料",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "subjective_change",
          "type": "multi",
          "label": "患者/家属诉",
          "options": [
            "患肢力量较前明显改善",
            "稍有改善",
            "无变化",
            "站立稳定性变好",
            "站立稳定性无变化"
          ],
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "fatigue",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "训练后疲劳感",
          "options": [
            "轻度",
            "明显",
            "无"
          ],
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "vas",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "疼痛VAS",
          "unit": "分",
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "dizziness",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "有无头晕不适",
          "options": [
            "无",
            "有"
          ],
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "family_demand",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "家属诉求",
          "hint": "例：继续练习步行训练"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "o",
      "label": "O",
      "heading": "客观资料",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "mmt_upper",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "肌力MMT 上肢",
          "unit": "级",
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "mmt_lower",
          "type": "number",
          "label": "肌力MMT 下肢",
          "unit": "级",
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "ashworth",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "肌张力Ashworth",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "0级",
            "1级",
            "1+级",
            "2级",
            "3级",
            "4级"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "sit_balance",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "坐位平衡",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "Ⅰ级",
            "Ⅱ级",
            "Ⅲ级"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "stand_balance",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "站立平衡",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "无法站立",
            "Ⅰ级",
            "Ⅱ级",
            "Ⅲ级"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "transfer",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "床椅转移",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "完全辅助",
            "部分辅助",
            "监护独立",
            "完全独立"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "fall_risk",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "跌倒风险",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "高风险",
            "中风险",
            "低风险"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "rom",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "关节活动度",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "正常",
            "轻度受限",
            "中度受限",
            "重度受限"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "gait",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "步行能力",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "无步行能力",
            "辅助步行",
            "独立步行"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "vital_signs",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "生命体征",
          "options": [
            "平稳",
            "波动"
          ],
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "a",
      "label": "A",
      "heading": "评估分析",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "prev_goal",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "前期短期目标",
          "options": [
            "已完成",
            "基本完成",
            "未完成"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "impairment",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "功能障碍程度",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "重度",
            "中度",
            "轻度"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "core_problem",
          "type": "multi",
          "label": "现存核心问题",
          "prefill": "last_assessment",
          "options": [
            "下肢负重耐力不足",
            "站立稳定性欠佳",
            "步态异常",
            "肌力不足",
            "躯干核心差",
            "患侧负重不足"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "potential",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "康复潜力",
          "options": [
            "持续良好",
            "一般",
            "较差"
          ],
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "goal_long",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "更新长期目标",
          "hint": "例：出院可监护下室内独立步行，自主完成转移，居家安全活动"
        },
        {
          "key": "goal_short",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "更新短期目标（下2周）",
          "hint": "例：监护下独立站立，可辅助短距离步行"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "p",
      "label": "P",
      "heading": "康复计划",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "therapy_items",
          "type": "multi",
          "label": "本次训练项目",
          "required": true,
          "options_source": "therapy_options",
          "prefill": "last_daily"
        },
        {
          "key": "adjustment",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "调整训练方案",
          "hint": "例：保留肌力平衡训练，新增踏步/步态预备训练"
        },
        {
          "key": "frequency",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "频次时长",
          "options": [
            "每日1次，30min，每周5次",
            "每日1次，25min，每周5次"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "safety",
          "type": "multi",
          "label": "安全要点",
          "options": [
            "步行训练全程陪护",
            "严防跌倒",
            "控制训练负荷",
            "避免异常拖拽步态"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "education",
          "type": "multi",
          "label": "宣教",
          "options": [
            "纠正站立姿势",
            "家属训练时做好防护",
            "良肢位摆放"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "next_review",
          "type": "single",
          "label": "下次复评",
          "options": [
            "2周后",
            "再20次治疗后"
          ],
          "prefill": "last_assessment"
        },
        {
          "key": "extra_note",
          "type": "text",
          "label": "备注",
          "hint": "选填。留空则记录里不显示这一项。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "footer": [
    "治疗师签名：__________"
  ]
}
